WEBVTT

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.470
Good morning.

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:26.670
<i>I don't think I'll ever get used 
to starting the day like this...</i>

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:29.920
<i>One night, when the moon was shining bright,</i>

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.550
<i>a certain girl saved my life.</i>

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:37.800
<i>This really cute girl ended up being the wife 
I would promise to spend the future with.</i>

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:42.640
<i>Now, living under the same roof, 
our newlywed life has begun.</i>

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:46.000
<i>This is the story of a couple 
who had a strange first meeting,</i>

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.830
<i>and ended up together with an 
irreplaceable bond between them.</i>

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:56.030
TONIKAWA

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:56.030
<b>~ Uniform ~</b>

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:05.500
Darling, what are you doing?

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.560
Some tables I was asked to put together.

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:10.640
This job involves building a database.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:13.050
So, you're programming right now?

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:14.760
Yep, I sure am.

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:19.600
And me playing a video game right 
next to you doesn't distract you?

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:20.550
Not really.

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:22.470
It's no bother at all.

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:24.120
<i>That's impressive.</i>

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:27.310
<i>I'd be way too curious to be able to focus.</i>

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:29.640
<i>I wonder...</i>

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:34.310
<i>Just how much focus does my darling have?</i>

