<b><i>Traveling Q</i></b>

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:38.940
<i>This time on </i>Traveling Q<i>...</i>

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:41.830
<b><i>Finding the Quiz Champion at the Ends of the Earth!!</i></b>

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:41.830
<i>It's a global mental gymnastics special!</i>

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:45.580
<i>We're glad to have you 
with us again this week!</i>

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:48.140
<i>I'm your host, Taki-chan!</i>

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:51.590
<b>Natsuki Taki</b>

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:51.590
<b>Q-kun</b>

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:52.480
<i>I hope you're ready to run 
some Qs through your head!</i>

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:52.440
Look, darling!

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:54.600
It's the girl we met at the service area!

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.930
Oh, I remember her!

00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:59.500
Are you any good at quiz 
shows like this, darling?

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.350
I don't think so, not really.

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:04.810
My knowledge tends to be 
tailored toward passing exams.

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:05.980
<i>He says that,</i>

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:08.480
<i>but at the same time, his hands 
haven't stopped for a second.</i>

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.060
<i>He's not just...</i>

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:14.300
<i>slapping a bunch of keys at random, is he?</i>

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:17.180
Well, there are figs in the fridge.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:18.840
Why don't we put them on the line in a bet?

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:21.370
Aw, I dunno about that...

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:24.870
<i>And here's our first question!</i>

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:24.870
<b>Question 1</b>

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:28.020
<i>Here we have Ruka-chan and her mom.</i>

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:29.830
<b>Ruka-chan</b>

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:29.830
<b>Mom</b>

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:31.740
<i>Ruka-chan's mom is 4 times Ruka's own age.</i>

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:34.500
<b>Age</b>

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:34.590
<b>Age x 4</b>

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:37.010
<b>Age + 4</b>

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:36.720
<i>After four years, Mom will 
be 3 times Ruka-chan's age.</i>

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.010
<b>Age x 3</b>

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:41.140
<i>So, how old are Ruka-chan 
and her mom right now?</i>

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:41.140
<b><i>What ages are Ruka-chan and her mom?</i></b>

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.640
<i>That's a hard one.</i>

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:47.790
<i>My mom is 43 years old, but...</i>

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:49.990
<i>That's not part of the quiz!</i>

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:55.080
W-Well, if her mom is 25, 
then Ruka-chan would be...

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:58.330
Ruka-chan is eight, and her mom is 32.

00:02:58.920 --> 00:02:59.880
Huh?

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.530
That's the answer.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:06.220
If we suppose the mom is somewhere 
between 20 and 100 years old,

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:09.960
there are 21 patterns where 
she's four times her daughter's age.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:14.110
If you then add 4, and look
 for a quotient of 3,

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.950
the only choice is the pair of 12 and 36,

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:20.020
which means that right now, 
they're eight and 32 years old.

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:23.650
I kind of brute forced the answer, though.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.990
There's probably a better 
way to figure it out.

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:30.060
Simultaneous equations would 
probably be the cleanest.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:30.060
<b>How long do turtles live?</b>

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:30.060
<b>Suirenji Ruka</b>

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.870
Darling, is math your specialty?

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:36.280
Nah. I just practiced until 
I got the hang of it.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:39.160
<i>The answer is eight and 32 years old!</i>

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:41.230
Oh, great! I got it.

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:43.360
<i>O-Okay, I see...</i>

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:47.460
<i>I guess this isn't enough to distract him.</i>

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:51.710
<i>Not that I have any good reason 
to distract him, mind you.</i>

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.900
Okay, I'm caught up on the situation!

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.010
Mankind will go extinct!

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:57.590
...extinct!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:58.090
...extinct!

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.090
Aya-san?!

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.090
Aya?!

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:01.630
Your little quiz game 
with figs on the line...

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.720
I'm joining the fray!

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:06.000
How do you know about that 
if you just got here?!

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.600
I see!

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:10.640
Well, I happen to like figs, too.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:11.970
So count me in!

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:13.100
Charlotte?

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:15.450
And you're here on your own?

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:16.310
Yep!

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:18.610
Chitose-chan told me to check in on you.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:21.210
I also brought somen noodles as a gift.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:22.360
Thank you...

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.610
<i>And now for question two!</i>

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:24.610
<b>Question 2</b>

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:27.870
<i>This next one's a bit harder!</i>

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:34.830
<b></b>21 Chocolate Bars

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:30.520
<i>Here we have 21 chocolate bars!</i>

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:34.040
<i>With two people taking turns picking 
them up, in groups of one to four...</i>

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.940
<i>The person to grab the 
last one is the winner!</i>

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.150
<i></i><b>Grab the Last One to Win</b>

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.150
<i></i><b>Grab the Last One to Win</b>

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:39.370
<i>And so, how do you win?</i>

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:42.380
<b>What's the trick to winning?!</b>

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:42.380
<i>What's the secret trick to ensure 
you get the last chocolate?!</i>

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.080
Uh, wait a second...

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:46.390
I'm not even sure what they're asking.

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:49.190
You can make sure you win? How would you...

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:52.140
You have to go first, and choose just one.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.240
Huh?

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:56.470
Well, to get the 21st chocolate,

00:04:56.470 --> 00:05:00.160
you need to make sure the other person 
lands within the range of 17-20,

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:02.150
which means you need to get the 16th one.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:05.440
To make sure you get the 
16th one, you'll want the 11th.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.600
To get the 11th, you'll want the 6th.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:11.940
If you follow that logic all the way back, 
you realize you need the first bar.

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:14.550
That question was easier, to be honest.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:16.640
Tsukacchan, this is bad!

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:20.180
There's no way we'll win this unless 
we can distract Nasa-kun!

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:21.730
Maybe so, but...

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:24.710
In that case, I have a great idea!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.590
Come with me!

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:27.930
What is it?

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:29.600
We're having a strategy meeting!

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.340
R-Right!

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:34.460
So, what's your great idea?

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:38.980
What better way is there to distract a boy...

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:42.480
than with a charming girl? Right?

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:46.440
But he's already got an adorable wife.

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:48.110
She needs to do more than just exist!

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:49.870
It's time to really pour on the charm.

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:51.730
Which is to say...

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:54.000
She needs to put on my maid's uniform

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:57.300
and seduce her darling!

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:00.170
What?! A maid's uniform?!

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:04.880
Yep! There's not a guy on this planet 
who doesn't love maid uniforms.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:07.680
So, if she puts mine on...

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:10.640
Nasa-kun will be so distracted, 
he'll make a mistake!

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.080
Wait, but even if—

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.890
No ifs, ands, or buts!

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:16.660
It's...

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:19.400
It's for the sake of the figs!

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:21.980
So, please!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:24.400
Become a maid!

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:28.540
O-Okay...

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:31.980
Nasa-kun!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:33.560
Here we go!

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:35.410
Let's see how you handle this!

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.170
Why's she dressed like that?!

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:46.730
This is your chance, Tsukacchan!

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:48.280
Finish him off with the thing!

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:50.180
D-Do I seriously have to say it?

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:51.400
Of course you do!

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:53.300
This ends here! Go, go!

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:06.320
A-Are you prepared to lose... m-master?

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:11.220
There it is!

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:15.560
<i>Now, how many prime numbers 
are there between 1 and 10?</i>

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.350
Four of them.

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.080
That's correct!

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.450
<b>Congratulations, Winner</b>

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:21.210
<b></b>About 4?

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:21.210
<i>Ruka-chan is our winner!</i>

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:23.510
Why was he able to answer?!

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:24.710
No fair!

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.910
Why, why, why, why?!

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:30.520
And why weren't you affected by 
seeing her like this, Nasa-kun?!

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.760
Well... I was.

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:37.260
It's so cute... I thought I might die.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.020
Thanks...

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:43.720
You wanna... eat those figs?

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:45.540
Let's all share them.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.820
<i>Tsukasa-chan dressed like a maid...</i>

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.410
<i>That was super awesome!</i>

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:03.420
I think I get it. No wonder 
maid cafés are so popular.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.440
I mean, you get served by girls 
in that kind of outfit, right?

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:08.170
I can see the appeal...

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.610
It's not even a little risque,
 but so powerful...

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.050
It's totally crazy!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:15.930
It'd be enough to put the perfect 
superman down for the count!

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:19.680
I wonder if she'd wear it again!

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:23.940
No, calm down. That's asking too much.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:28.940
It might have been cute, but I can't just 
ask her to wear a maid uniform again.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.990
But that maid uniform was really cute.

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:38.910
<i>I didn't realize he was 
into that kind of thing.</i>

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:42.340
<i>But would he be glad if I wore it again?</i>

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.500
Darling...

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:50.220
Y-Yes? Wh-What is it, Tsukasa-chan?

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:53.220
Do you want me to wear the uniform again?

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:55.070
Th-That's not it!

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:59.100
It's more like, it looks really great, or I 
want to see you looking cute again, or sorta...

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:59.100
Ch-Charlotte...

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:03.600
Sh-She said there were extras, and left it behind.

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:05.350
See?

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:08.860
I see.

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:12.860
Do you want me to put it on again?

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:16.450
Uh... well...

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.120
Of course!

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:27.610
Some other time!

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:29.910
You're kind of scaring me!

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:31.200
I'm not scary!

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:32.970
It'll just have to wait!

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.940
You'll never find a more mild-mannered guy!

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.090
Tsukasa-chan?!

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:40.180
What kinda cosplay are you into, Senpai?

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:42.110
Wh-Wh-Where did that come from?!

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:44.350
It's actually a big issue.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:49.100
You're gonna need to know what cosplay 
your wife can wear to get you going,

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.360
for when the time comes.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:53.910
Whoa, whoa, what "time" are we talking about?!

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:56.600
Obviously, for when things 
start to cool off at night.

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:59.600
Believe me, it's still plenty thrilling!

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:03.040
Really, the fact that anyone still turns 
bright red at the sight of a maid uniform...

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.320
You're a cheap date, aren't you?

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:07.620
Did Aya-san tell you about yesterday?

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:09.160
Of course!

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:12.880
Your newlywed life is a communal 
treasure in this household!

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.170
I have an obligation to report the facts!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:18.880
Do you have to share every 
little thing without asking?!

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:23.380
So, are maids, like, your number one choice?

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:27.640
Maid uniforms are nice and all, but...

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:32.900
If I had a favorite, it'd be... 
a lab coat and glasses, maybe?

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:35.460
Nasa-kun, you're so pervy!

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:38.780
I mean, you made it sound like 
I had to pick something!

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.210
What's this about a lab coat and glasses?

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:43.560
Well, y'know, it's like the 
glasses go with the lab coat,

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:45.020
and the lab coat goes with the glasses...

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:46.410
And that's where love comes from!

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:53.290
I guess cosplay is fine and all,

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:59.560
but the two of you haven't done any normal 
romantic stuff like people your age do, right?

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:00.200
Huh?

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:06.800
<i>She's right. I've never gone out with 
a girl before now, or even liked one.</i>

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:09.690
<i>Is this how a relationship is supposed to be?</i>

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:13.160
<i>In terms of age, we're high school students.</i>

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:16.690
<i>So shouldn't there be romantic events 
that people our age encounter?</i>

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:20.140
What exactly is normal romance 
for high schoolers, anyway?!

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:22.200
Isn't it obvious?

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:24.700
Dates in your school uniforms.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:25.650
Huh?

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:26.590
Exactly!

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:29.580
Going on dates in school uniforms has 
become a global movement at this point!

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:33.960
The term "seifuku date" has been 
adopted all over the world!

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:37.010
Is it seriously that big of a deal now?!

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:38.970
I can't blame you for not knowing.

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:42.720
Math nerds like you usually don't 
know squat about the world at large.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:42.720
<b>* This is her personal opinion</b>

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:48.410
I see... Well, we never went to 
high school, so we don't have uniforms.

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:49.850
No worries there!

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:53.930
I happen to have uniforms 
from all kinds of schools!

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:55.860
Why do you have so many?!

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:57.850
It's totally normal.

00:11:57.850 --> 00:12:01.880
All Japanese high school students 
have multiple uniforms!

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:06.410
<b>* Actual numbers may vary</b>

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:04.030
Uniform dates are hot in Germany right now,

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.790
and the girls over there have 
eight or nine per person!

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:07.870
<b>* Citation needed</b>

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:07.870
Really?

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.390
But even if she had one...

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:13.070
Does Tsukasa-chan seem like she'd wear it?

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:15.130
I getcha.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.040
Still!

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:19.130
Are you really just gonna give up, Senpai?!

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:21.130
As a man...

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:23.300
No, as a husband!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:27.400
Don't you want to see your wife 
dressed like a schoolgirl?!

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:28.390
...girl?!

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:29.620
...girl?!

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:30.640
I do!

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:33.810
A version of her that 
no one else has ever seen...

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.360
I'm talking about rarity!

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:40.110
SSS rarity, the kind that no amount 
of gacha luck could ever bring you!

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:43.400
Can you die without ever 
seeing it for yourself?!

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:47.280
I really want to. Please!

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:49.910
Leave it to me, then!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:53.970
I swear, I'll get Tsukacchan 
into a school uniform!

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:54.540
...uniform!

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:55.170
...uniform!

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:58.800
Tsukacchan, do you have a sec?

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:00.050
Shouldn't you be in school?

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:02.550
That doesn't matter right now!

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:05.910
Don't you want to go on a date with 
Nasa-kun while wearing a school uniform?

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:07.460
What are you talking about?

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:11.310
Are you gonna do a school 
uniform date or not?!

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:15.080
Well, no? I don't have a school uniform.

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:16.320
I can lend you one!

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:17.560
No, that's okay.

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:20.800
Besides, wearing a uniform when 
you're not actually a student...

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.320
That's kinda embarrassing.

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:25.170
Oh, I see.

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:28.070
Well, you are cute, Tsukacchan...

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:31.830
But you probably wouldn't 
look good in a uniform.

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:34.880
You've got a point. I guess 
that's all there is to it.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:36.290
Now, hold on!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.660
How can we know unless I try it on?!

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.840
<b>Competitive Streak Activated</b>

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:43.050
Aw, come on, it's <i>so</i> obvious!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:47.980
There's no way a cool beauty like you 
would look good in a school uniform.

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:50.350
Okay, in that case...

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.400
Bring the uniform here!

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:53.660
I'll try it on!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.270
She says she'll try it.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.100
How'd you manage that?!

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:02.960
Why are you two here?

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:03.920
Aw, come on!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:06.020
You can't just have her all to yourself.

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:10.460
Doesn't seem like the kind of 
thing you show off, is all...

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:11.370
<i>I guess he's...</i>

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.120
<i>...actually pretty particular about this stuff.</i>

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.580
I've finished changing.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:17.470
Come on in, then!

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:24.540
<i>School uniforms are really magical, 
as far as clothing goes.</i>

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:28.130
<i>They manage to be cute in a way 
that's impossible to argue against!</i>

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:29.630
Wh-What do you think?

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:30.580
Wow!

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:32.610
You're super cute!

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:33.630
Now, next up...

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:34.390
Hold this...

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:36.560
And say the line!

00:14:38.630 --> 00:14:41.400
"I-I'm gonna be late!"

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:44.810
So cute! You're so cute, 
I think my heart's gonna stop!

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:47.900
Now, pretend like you ran into someone!

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.670
Ow, ow, ow...

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:52.960
Now suddenly become 
self-conscious about your skirt!

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:54.250
"Eek!"

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:57.660
"What do you think you're 
looking at, you pervert?!"

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.520
How much more of this do I have to do?!

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.530
C'mon, it's fine!

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:04.960
The more you do, the more 
cuteness is on display!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:07.920
You think so too, don't you, Nasa-kun?

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:18.680
It's... really incredibly cute... yeah.

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.690
Thanks.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:27.940
Sorry, Tsukacchan.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.240
I wanted you to try the uniform on,

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:33.320
so I lied about thinking you 
wouldn't look good in it.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.850
Wait, you did?

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:39.310
And now that you've got it on, why not just 
head straight for a date at a theme park?

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:40.960
I dunno...

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.620
That'd be a little...

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:46.710
What's there to be embarrassed 
about after all this?

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:47.960
That's right!

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:55.620
<i>If only we really could...</i>

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:08.360
But, man, Tsukasa-chan was really 
cute in that school uniform.

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:12.000
<i>What is it about those 
uniforms that's so exciting?</i>

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.830
<i>It's actually kind of incredible!</i>

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:18.120
<i>I wonder if she'd be 
willing to wear it again...</i>

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:22.120
Darling, your internal 
monologue is leaking again.

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:24.130
Tsukasa-chan?!

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:26.610
You said something similar the other day.

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:28.130
I'm sorry for all the weird requests!

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.770
I mean, it seems like I 
keep making them lately...

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.770
It's nothing worth apologizing over...

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:33.160
That's no good! I really should know better!

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.940
I'm such a dummy!

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.640
Did I really look that good in the uniform?

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:38.050
O-Of course.

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:41.080
It was like... it hit 
on an instinctual level.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:43.520
Something about it really got me going.

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:48.950
I guess you have that side to you, too.

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:51.230
Huh?! Well, yeah...

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:53.780
Of course I do.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.750
There's no point in lying, so...

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:58.610
The fact is, it got me going.

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:00.100
I-I see.

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:03.540
I have to admit, I'm impressed with how 
manly you can be about stuff like this.

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:07.290
Right! Because I don't believe 
in lying about my own feelings!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:10.710
O-Okay. That's pretty 
praiseworthy, to be honest.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.010
Thank you very much!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.620
In that case...

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:21.560
Sh-Should I try it on again?

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:22.640
...on again?

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:23.310
<b>Boom</b>

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:23.310
...on again?

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:24.880
Will you?!

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:27.520
Yeah. If it'd make you that happy...

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:29.310
It would! Really happy! Super happy!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:33.310
Happy, happy, happy, happy, happy, happy, happy!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:33.310
Okay... I'll go get changed.

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:43.890
I'm done changing.

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:45.580
Come right on in!

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:54.990
S-So, what do you think this time?

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:58.590
Um... well...

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:03.600
You're so cute, I'm speechless.

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:05.890
Th-Thanks.

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:14.860
Still, there's something really weird about 
wearing a uniform when I don't go to school.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:18.610
It feels like I'm doing something naughty.

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:23.700
Tsukasa-chan, can I touch you?

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:28.980
N-No, I think that might be a little too much...

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:38.010
Sir, this is a hands-off establishment.

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:44.140
But... if you want to take 
my socks off, that'd be fine.

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:47.890
I-In that case...

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:02.220
I said no touching.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:05.820
S-Sorry, but I just...

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:18.420
Okay, then, as punishment,

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:20.900
you have to take the other sock off.

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:23.930
O-Okay.

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:25.470
But first...

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:28.740
One more time.

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:32.940
Don't lick my leg...

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.580
Darling?

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:44.950
How long are you going to be in bed?

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:54.210
Ts-Tsukasa-chan... That outfit...

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:56.400
You have work today, right?

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:58.960
You'd better hurry up and get ready...

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:01.720
Or you're gonna be <i>so</i> late!

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:04.890
You're right!

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:05.880
Darling?

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:06.610
Yeah?

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:07.850
Darling...

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:08.720
Huh?

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:11.100
Darling!

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:14.730
Good morning, darling.

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:19.000
You had a huge smile on your face.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:20.400
Pleasant dreams, I take it?

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:22.240
Huh?! Uh, yeah!

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:24.490
Breakfast is ready.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:26.190
You have work today, right?

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:30.860
Tsukasa-chan!

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:32.490
Listen...

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:35.720
Next time, could you wake 
me with the uniform on?

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:36.630
What?!

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:39.480
Why on earth would I do that?!

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:39.920
<i>That morning...</i>

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:40.440
Just once, please!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:44.300
<i>I think something may have
 awakened inside me.</i>

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:42.320
But why?!

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:45.090
I just want to see what it's like!
